{"speciesId":428,"names":{"fr":"Lockpin","es":"Lopunny","en":"Lopunny","ja":"ミミロップ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"An extremely cautious Pokémon. It cloaks its body with its fluffy ear fur when it senses danger."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is very conscious of its looks and never fails to groom its ears. It runs with sprightly jumps."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The ears appear to be delicate. If they are touched roughly, it kicks with its graceful legs."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It sheds its fur twice a year. Its winter fur is soft and fluffy."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It sheds its fur twice a year. Its winter fur is soft and fluffy."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est capable de décocher de puissants coups de pied si on touche à ses délicates oreilles."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The ears appear to be delicate. If they are touched roughly, it kicks with its graceful legs."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est capable de décocher de puissants coups de pied si on touche à ses délicates oreilles."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The ears appear to be delicate. If they are touched roughly, it kicks with its graceful legs."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Extremely cautious, it quickly bounds off when it senses danger."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Extremely cautious, it quickly bounds off when it senses danger."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il détecte le moindre danger. Il file discrètement par petits bonds rapides quand il se sent menacé."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Este Pokémon resulta muy precavido. Si siente peligro, escapa corriendo a grandes saltos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Extremely cautious, it quickly bounds off when it senses danger."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"警戒心が とても 強い。 危険を 感じると 軽やかに 飛び跳ねて 走り去ってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est capable de décocher de puissants coups de pied si on touche à ses délicates oreilles."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus orejas son muy delicadas. Si alguien las toca con brusquedad, recibirá una espléndida patada."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The ears appear to be delicate. If they are touched roughly, it kicks with its graceful legs."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"耳は とても デリケートらしく 優しく 丁寧に 触らないと しなやかな 脚で けられてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il détecte le moindre danger. Il file discrètement par petits bonds rapides quand il se sent menacé."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Este Pokémon resulta muy precavido. Si siente peligro, escapa corriendo a grandes saltos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Extremely cautious, it quickly bounds off when it senses danger."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"警戒心が とても 強い。 危険を 感じると 軽やかに 飛び跳ねて 走り去ってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il est capable de décocher de puissants coups de pied si on touche à ses délicates oreilles."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus orejas son muy delicadas. Si alguien las toca con brusquedad, recibirá una espléndida patada."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The ears appear to be delicate. If they are touched roughly, it kicks with its graceful legs."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"耳は とても デリケートらしく 優しく 丁寧に 触らないと しなやかな 脚で けられてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il mue deux fois par an. Les écharpes et les chapeaux fabriqués à partir de ses poils tiennent bien chaud."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Muda el pelo dos veces al año. Este se usa en la confección de unos gorros y bufandas que abrigan mucho."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Lopunny regrows its coat twice a year. Mufflers and hats made from its fur are really warm."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"年に ２回 毛が 生えかわる。 その毛を 使った マフラーや 帽子は とっても あたたかいぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est très vigilant et n’aime pas vraiment se battre, mais gare aux coups de patte dévastateurs qu’il peut décocher !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Es cauteloso y nada amante de los combates, pero puede propinar potentes patadas si la situación lo requiere."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It’s notably wary and has a dislike of fighting, but at the same time, it can deliver powerful kicks with its lithe legs."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"警戒心が 強く 戦いは 好まないが しなやかな 足から パワフルな キックを 繰り出すぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Constamment sur le qui-vive, il donne des coups de pied particulièrement dévastateurs si une menace approche."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Está siempre atento a lo que ocurre a su alrededor. Si advierte peligro, se defenderá con patadas de potencia devastadora."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Lopunny is constantly monitoring its surroundings. If danger approaches, this Pokémon responds with superdestructive kicks."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"まわりの 様子を つねに 気にして 危険が およぶと 破壊力 抜群の キックを おみまいする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"À la fin de la saison chaude, il mue et se recouvre d’une fourrure épaisse et légère pour se préparer à affronter le froid hivernal."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando acaba la estación más tórrida, le crece un nuevo pelaje muy mullido que lo prepara para el frío."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Once hot seasons are over, Lopunny’s coat will be replaced with fur that holds a lot of insulating air in preparation for colder weather."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"暑い 季節が 終わると 空気を たくさん 含んだ 体毛に 生え変わり 寒さに 備える。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its fur is warm and yet remarkably light. This Pokémon kicks as tho